```
|= Style    |= Sample      |
| italic    | /soft/        |
| strong    | *firm*        |
| code      | `literal`     |
.
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th scope="col">Style</th><th scope="col">Sample</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>italic</td><td><em>soft</em></td></tr>
    <tr><td>strong</td><td><strong>firm</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td>code</td><td><code>literal</code></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

